m4trace:/usr/share/aclocal/libtool.m4:1969: -1- AC_DEFUN([AC_LIBTOOL_SYS_MAX_CMD_LEN], [m4_warn([obsolete], [The macro 'AC_LIBTOOL_SYS_MAX_CMD_LEN' is obsolete.
You should run autoupdate.])dnl
